---
title: "Account"
description: "Manage your Photon profile, avatar, and account-level settings."
---

`photon account` manages the identity you signed in as — your profile, avatar,
OAuth connections, and service keys. None of it depends on your
[active project](/cli/projects#select-an-active-project). 10DLC registrations
are listed here but belong to the
[selected organization](/cli/organizations#select-an-organization).

The payment method and OAuth clients moved to
[`photon org`](/cli/organizations#moved-commands).

